  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/V62Now8.png\" alt=\"紋理變化的視覺化展示\"></p><h3>🐣 關於改動：</h3><h4>此資源包將生怪蛋的標準2D紋理替換為在第一人稱和第三人稱視角中手持時的3D模型。所有模型盡可能貼近其2D紋理。</h4><hr><h3>⏳ 即將推出的更新：</h3><h4>• 為 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fhold-my-items\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Hold My Items</a> v5.1 中每個蛋新增自訂且獨特的動畫</h4><h4>• 為擁有多種變體的生物提供3D和2D生怪蛋變體</h4><h4>• 透過 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252frespackopts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Respackopts</a> 進行某種資源包配置</h4><h4>• 模組相容性</h4><hr><h3>🔽 安裝方式：</h3><h4><strong><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\">Windows：</span></strong></h4><div class=\"spoiler\"><h4><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\"><strong>將.zip檔案解壓縮至路徑：</strong> C:\\Users\\(<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">您的使用者名稱</span>)\\AppData\\Roaming\\.minecraft\\resourcepacks</span></h4></div><h4><strong><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\">Linux：</span></strong></h4><div class=\"spoiler\"><h4><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\"><strong>將.zip檔案解壓縮至路徑：</strong> ~/.minecraft/resourcepacks</span></h4></div><h4><strong><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\">macOS：</span></strong></h4><div class=\"spoiler\"><p><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\"><strong>將.zip檔案解壓縮至路徑：</strong> ~/Library/Application Support/minecraft/resourcepacks</span></p></div><hr><h3>📄 致謝：</h3><h4>紋理由 CatFromNet（我本人）創作</h4><h4>靈感來自 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.minecraft.net%252fen-us%252fmarketplace%252fpdp%252foreville-studios%252factions--stuff-1.5.1%252f61c7a786-d7ad-49e0-a710-817121cd9795\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Actions &amp; Stuff</a> 附加元件</h4><hr><h3>📜 授權與發佈</h3><h4>下載或使用此資源包即表示您同意 CC BY-NC 4.0 授權條款。</h4><h4>未經作者明確許可，亦不得將修改版本用於商業用途。</h4><hr><div><a href=\"https://discord.gg/q29y59SWEu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/r22nQhg.png\" alt=\"Discord\" width=\"150\"> </a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fCatFromNet\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/5uCzwxA.png\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"150\"> </a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/catfromnet/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/UcxkgBy.png\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"150\"></a></div>",
